<title>POLAND: KABLE MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KABLE MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.60 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.60 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.10 vs   0.49 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   11.07 vs  11.67 loss</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.80 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.80 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.80 vs   0.25 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   34.70 vs  33.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Slaska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
